      "content": "It's hard to call it a confrontation when I'm just waiting for the blade to fall from their hands. If I take it myself... if I end it here before they break me... is that really a symbol of pride? Or am I just choosing the quickest way out? I need to know if an old soldier like you thinks there's any honor in a man making his own exit.",
